{"id":"4aa7579d0d4e75dc","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-computable-martingale.md","title":"可计算实值鞅","display":"df-computable-martingale — 可计算实值鞅","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-computable-martingale","aliases":["43-df-computable-martingale"],"display":"df-computable-martingale — 可计算实值鞅","depends_on":["[[43-df-martingale]]","[[43-df-computable]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§10.2 Definition 10.2.3及Lemma 10.4.1，印刷214、219，PDF234、239","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-computable-martingale"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-computable-martingale</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-computable-martingale — 可计算实值鞅"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0038977b84ae1a9f\" href=\"?note=0038977b84ae1a9f\" title=\"43-df-martingale\">43-df-martingale</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§10.2 Definition 10.2.3及Lemma 10.4.1，印刷214、219，PDF234、239"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\">\\(d:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Computable}\">\\(\\mathrm{Computable}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Martingale}\">\\(\\mathrm{Martingale}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0038977b84ae1a9f\" href=\"?note=0038977b84ae1a9f\" title=\"43-df-martingale\">43-df-martingale</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ComputableMartingale}\">\\(\\mathrm{ComputableMartingale}\\)</span> 是函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\">\\(d:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\)</span> 上的布尔谓词，计算性通过统一有理Cauchy近似解释。有限串和有理数采用固定可计算编码；下式的函数类型 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb Q\">\\(q:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb Q\\)</span> 明确要求q在整个指定域上总定义，以下Assertion给出其定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ComputableMartingale}(d)\\iff\\mathrm{Martingale}(d)\\land\\exists q:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb Q\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Computable}(q)\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;|q(\\sigma,k)-d(\\sigma)|\\le2^{-k}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ComputableMartingale}(d)\\iff\\mathrm{Martingale}(d)\\land\\exists q:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb Q\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Computable}(q)\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;|q(\\sigma,k)-d(\\sigma)|\\le2^{-k}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>统一双侧有效近似比下半可计算更强。可计算随机性的定义可等价限制到有理值可计算鞅。</p>\n<p>来源：§10.2 Definition 10.2.3及Lemma 10.4.1，印刷214、219，PDF234、239。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地补充另行注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-martingale","status":"resolved","id":"0038977b84ae1a9f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-martingale]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $d:2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}$。$\\mathrm{Computable}$ 见 [[43-df-computable]]，$\\mathrm{Martingale}$ 见 [[43-df-martingale]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-martingale","status":"resolved","id":"0038977b84ae1a9f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $d:2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}$。$\\mathrm{Computable}$ 见 [[43-df-computable]]，$\\mathrm{Martingale}$ 见 [[43-df-martingale]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"d:2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Computable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Martingale}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ComputableMartingale}","display":false},{"tex":"d:2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}","display":false},{"tex":"q:2^{<\\omega}\\times\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ComputableMartingale}(d)\\iff\\mathrm{Martingale}(d)\\land\\exists q:2^{<\\omega}\\times\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb Q\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Computable}(q)\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}\\;\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;|q(\\sigma,k)-d(\\sigma)|\\le2^{-k}\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1651,"backlinks":[{"id":"52fd5856a06d2543","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$；$d$ 遍历 $2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}$。$\\mathrm{ComputableMartingale}$ 见 [[43-df-computable-martingale]]，$\\mathrm{Covers}$ 见 [[43-df-covers]]。"},{"id":"59be57c107bd283a","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $d:2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}$，$X\\in2^\\omega$；$\\mathrm{ComputableMartingale}$、$\\mathrm{ComputableOrder}$ 分别见 [[43-df-computable-martingale]]、[[43-df-computable-order]]。"},{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-165","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-computable-martingale]] — 可计算实值鞅"},{"id":"12abc35e91616bca","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"设 $d:2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}$；可计算鞅、离散总计算、成功见 [[43-df-computable-martingale]]、[[43-df-computable]]、[[43-df-covers]]。"},{"id":"ce78261af74de716","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$；定义见 [[43-df-kurtzrandom]]、[[43-df-computable-martingale]]、[[43-df-computable-order]]。"}],"outgoing":["0038977b84ae1a9f","f357216a7edb035a"]}